# ISO 27001:2022 — Annex-A Controls → Gate Traceability

> Overlay-driven traceability for project **<%= projectName %>** (governance
> **<%= governanceLevel %>**, `industryOverlay: iso27001`). Unlike a coverage
> scorecard, this document is a **Definition-of-Done**: each listed Annex-A
